  "assets": [
    {
      "uuid": "1af55fb2-e152-43d6-8af5-5fb2e152a3d6",
      "name": "Getting Started.md",
      "path": "Assets/Tutorials/Getting Started.md",
      "assetType": "other",
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "byteLength": 1193,
      "source": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: top-down\n---\n# Welcome to Nova 26.17 Navigation and streamed worlds\n\nThis project was created from the **top-down** template. Open the Scene, Assets, Script, Debug, and Manage workspaces to explore the configured systems. Dismiss this tutorial from its Asset Inspector when you are ready.\n\n## Controls and setup (en)\n\nPlay: WASD to move; E spawns an enemy. Enter the exit zone on the right to save a checkpoint and open Main Menu.\n\n### Expected result\n\nThe player moves through a tiled world, spawns enemies and reaches the exit scene.\n\nRequirements: Ready offline · Keyboard\n\n## Steuerung und Einrichtung (de)\n\nPlay: WASD bewegt; E erzeugt einen Gegner. Die rechte Ausgangszone speichert einen Checkpoint und öffnet Main Menu.\n\n### Erwartetes Ergebnis\n\nDie Figur bewegt sich durch die Kachelwelt, erzeugt Gegner und erreicht die Ausgangsszene.\n\nVoraussetzungen: Offline bereit · Tastatur\n\n## 操作与准备 (zh)\n\n播放后用 WASD 移动，E 生成敌人。进入右侧出口区域会保存检查点并打开 Main Menu 场景。\n\n### 预期结果\n\n玩家可在瓦片世界移动、生成敌人并到达出口场景。\n\n使用要求: 离线可用 · 键盘\n",
      "sourceModified": 0,
      "importedAt": 0,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "duration": 0,
      "fontFamily": "",
      "settings": {
        "filterMode": "Linear",
        "compression": "Lossless",
        "pixelsPerUnit": 100,
        "spriteRegion": null,
        "pivot": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.5
        },
        "atlas": false
      },
      "pipeline": {
        "importerVersion": "template-4.2",
        "platform": "web",
        "sourceHash": "9b43e42c128f610a72154284c06ba5de3493cc8ec7cb6abd3812cc7f9cbcb75b",
        "artifactHash": "9b43e42c128f610a72154284c06ba5de3493cc8ec7cb6abd3812cc7f9cbcb75b",
        "contentHash": "9b43e42c128f610a72154284c06ba5de3493cc8ec7cb6abd3812cc7f9cbcb75b",
        "cacheKey": "9b43e42c128f610a72154284c06ba5de3493cc8ec7cb6abd3812cc7f9cbcb75b",
        "status": "ready",
        "lastValidSource": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: top-down\n---\n# Welcome to Nova 26.17 Navigation and streamed worlds\n\nThis project was created from the **top-down** template. Open the Scene, Assets, Script, Debug, and Manage workspaces to explore the configured systems. Dismiss this tutorial from its Asset Inspector when you are ready.\n\n## Controls and setup (en)\n\nPlay: WASD to move; E spawns an enemy. Enter the exit zone on the right to save a checkpoint and open Main Menu.\n\n### Expected result\n\nThe player moves through a tiled world, spawns enemies and reaches the exit scene.\n\nRequirements: Ready offline · Keyboard\n\n## Steuerung und Einrichtung (de)\n\nPlay: WASD bewegt; E erzeugt einen Gegner. Die rechte Ausgangszone speichert einen Checkpoint und öffnet Main Menu.\n\n### Erwartetes Ergebnis\n\nDie Figur bewegt sich durch die Kachelwelt, erzeugt Gegner und erreicht die Ausgangsszene.\n\nVoraussetzungen: Offline bereit · Tastatur\n\n## 操作与准备 (zh)\n\n播放后用 WASD 移动，E 生成敌人。进入右侧出口区域会保存检查点并打开 Main Menu 场景。\n\n### 预期结果\n\n玩家可在瓦片世界移动、生成敌人并到达出口场景。\n\n使用要求: 离线可用 · 键盘\n",
        "error": "",
        "dependencies": [],
        "reverseDependencies": [],
        "cacheHit": false
      }
    },
    {
      "uuid": "46448320-ae63-47ac-8644-8320ae6397ac",
      "name": "TopDownController.rhai",
      "path": "Assets/Scripts/TopDownController.rhai",
      "assetType": "script",
      "mimeType": "text/x-rhai",
      "byteLength": 489,
      "source": "@export(type=\"float\", min=0, max=30, step=0.1, group=\"Movement\", tooltip=\"Top-down movement speed\") let speed = 7.0;\nfn update(dt) {\n  let move = input_vector(\"Move\");\n  set_velocity(move.x * speed, move.y * speed);\n  if input_pressed(\"Spawn\") { instantiate(\"asset://8ffe0f90-5a7f-4f24-8ffe-0f905a7fcf24\"); }\n}\nfn on_trigger_enter(other, px, py, nx, ny, rvx, rvy) {\n  save_set(\"last_trigger\", other);\n  save_set(\"checkpoint\", [px, py]);\n  save_commit(\"slot1\");\n  scene_load(\"Main Menu\");\n}",
      "sourceModified": 0,
      "importedAt": 0,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "duration": 0,
      "fontFamily": "",
      "settings": {
